# GitHub-relative shortcuts. These resolve on github.com but not on disk,
# which is the point — they keep issue links working in forks.
issues/new
security/advisories/new

# TODO(launch): remove once reviso.dev has DNS.
^https://reviso\.dev

# Both of these answer fine from a laptop and reset or time out from a GitHub
# runner — the usual datacenter-IP throttling. Excluded from the weekly
# external sweep too, so it doesn't file an issue every Monday about a link
# that isn't broken.
^https://vyttle\.com
# Vendored verbatim in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md; not our link to maintain.
^https://www\.contributor-covenant\.org

# Example links inside the vendored recipe snapshot (eval/reference/); one
# points at a private Anthropic repo and 404s from anywhere. Vendored
# verbatim; not our links to maintain.
^https://github\.com/anthropics/claude-cli-internal
^https://github\.com/anthropics/claude-code/blob
